{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122181","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122181/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122181/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122181/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122181","id":5086999317,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc773_sq","number":122181,"title":"Fix shader code completion suggesting already declared functions","user":{"login":"LWWZH","id":224681405,"node_id":"U_kgDODWRdvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224681405?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH","html_url":"https://github.com/LWWZH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-07T04:52:53Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T09:23:27Z","closed_at":"2026-08-08T20:52:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122181","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122181","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122181.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122181.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #122087\n\n## Summary\n\nWhen adding a new function *before* an already declared one (e.g. typing `void` on a line above the existing `fragment()`), code completion suggested main function names that were already declared. This happened because the parser aborts on the incomplete function declaration at the completion position, so `shader->vfunctions` never contains the functions that appear after the caret, and the `COMPLETION_MAIN_FUNCTION` filter cannot exclude them.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `servers/rendering/shader_language.cpp`: when a code completion is triggered while parsing a function/constant name with an empty identifier, skip the incomplete declaration (`break` out of the top-level parse switch) instead of returning a parse error. Parsing resumes right after the caret, so declarations below the completion position are registered normally.\n- Non-completion parses are unaffected: the skip is guarded by `_get_completable_identifier()` returning `true` (a completion cursor is present), otherwise the previous error path is kept.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Reproduced from the issue: new shader, `void` on a line above the existing `fragment()`, trigger completion with an empty function name. Before: `fragment` was suggested. After: only still-missing main functions (e.g. `vertex`, `light`) are suggested.\n- Adding a function below an existing one keeps the existing behavior.\n","closed_by":{"login":"LWWZH","id":224681405,"node_id":"U_kgDODWRdvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224681405?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH","html_url":"https://github.com/LWWZH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LWWZH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122181/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122181/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}